1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Every manager gets this wrong.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,600
Forty thousand comes in. You keep thirty-eight oh ninety-five.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:10,400
The tax is already inside it, so you take five percent off.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,600
But five percent of what?

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:19,200
Nobody ever charged five percent of forty thousand.

6
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,800
Cut your price into twenty parts. The tax is one more part.

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:28,400
So what came in is twenty-one parts, not twenty.

8
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:32,000
Forty thousand over twenty-one. That is the whole tax.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,800
Subtracting hands over ninety-five too much. Every invoice.
